  /// keyboard). At most 8 rows of at most 8 buttons; each button has text (<=64
  /// chars) and exactly one of callback_data (<=64 bytes, comes back to you as
  /// a callback_query update), url (https only, opened after a confirm dialog),
  /// or copy_text (copied to the clipboard).
  ///
  /// [clientMessageId] Optional. Your own UUID for this send, at most 64
  /// characters. A second call naming the same id returns the message the first
  /// call already sent instead of posting a duplicate.
