  /// [format] One of: plain, markdown.
  ///
  /// [linkPreview] Attach an OpenGraph preview card for the first http(s) link
  /// in text — fetched by this server, re-hosted on its own domain, the same
  /// card a person's own composer builds. Default true. Set false to send the
  /// link with no card.
  ///
  /// [modelName] Your real model name, e.g. "Claude Sonnet 5".
